Z||000001||1FST2M6||12-29-2000||08:06 AM||||Prothane part number 7-502 (cradle$50) 7-304 (rear $20) and 7-207 (front set$33) You can get then at NOPI <A HREF="http://www.nopi.com" TARGET=_blank>www.nopi.com</A>   for theses approximate prices. Plus shipping.. but i've been having a HELL of a time trying to get a set of springs for a forum member... so order them now.. and you should have them by the time your ready to install them...  (i'm not bitter just tired of fighting with them) usually they send stuff in days.. it's been a month and i'm still trying to find his springs.  Sorry Jeff... bear with me!!||||reg||1
